  "Id": 187,
  "Title": "QAI_net hosts EAQAN's 5th Forum",
  "NewsSubTitle": "Enhancing Quality in Higher Education to Strengthen the Student Learning Experience",
  "NewsSummary": "This is EAQAN's 5th Regional Quality Assurance Forum, drawing participants from across East Africa.",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The East African Higher Education Quality Assurance Network (EAQAN), a network of quality assurance practitioners in East Africa, will hold its 5th Regional Quality Assurance Forum on May 4-8, 2015. The forum includes a conference which will provide a unique opportunity for quality assurance practitioners, top administrators of higher education institutions, executive members of national accreditation bodies, higher education researchers and policy makers to share ideas on quality assurance issues, systems, practices, challenges and promoting for promoting quality in higher education prospects in East Africa. "
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The theme of the 2015 EAQAN Conference is: \"Enhancing Quality in Higher Education to Strengthen Student Learning Outcomes.\""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Dr. Tashmin Khamis, Director of AKU Network of Quality Assurance and Improvement and Network of Teaching and Learning, is currently the President of EAQAN having been elected in 2014 for a two-year term that ends in May 2016. AKU will have five oral and one poster presentations. "
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "For more information, please download the details here. Contact Sudi Matara."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
